  "supportRules": {
    "surface": "Parent small decor to a tabletop socket and use the parent sort anchor plus a child draw offset. Recompute local offset for each direction.",
    "surface_edge": "Use per-frame pot-base pivot for TrailingPlant. Vines hang below support; do not align vine tips with tabletop.",
    "seat": "Attach to a sofa/chair cushion socket; avoid seats with baked pillows.",
    "wall": "Attach to a wall plane. Do not allow arbitrary floor drops. Left/Right architectural views are oblique artwork, not a modular tile wall kit.",
    "ground": "Rugs render under furniture and actors; do not add solid colliders."
  },
  "attachmentNote": "This pack defines categories and pivots. Furniture-specific attachment sockets, snapping and collision logic still need to be implemented in the game engine.",
